[{"title":"望汉王城","author":"魏初","text":"阴阴楼阁复层层，脚底风烟绿树平。\n行到上方人不见，倚阑独有汉王城。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10407,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"独石","author":"魏初","text":"打头土屋椽如漆，容膝荆床雨似秋。\n分例一杯糜子酒，几时能近凤凰楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10408,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"洋州公宇读文与可苏东坡诗刻","author":"魏初","text":"筼筜太守雪堂诗，花满亭台酒满池。\n今日水空花老尽，一庭秋草罥虫丝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10409,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宋氏家藏花光墨梅","author":"魏初","text":"人说花光物外仙，文章豪客欲移船。\n春风留在三花树，要与东溪结后缘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10410,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寒食不出","author":"魏初","text":"想得西湖放满船，御街杨柳已生烟。\n轻风细雨无人到，独立海棠花树边。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10411,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"冬除","author":"魏初","text":"行役经秋未到家，入冬消息望灯花。\n拥衾坐数更筹了，明日春生喜有涯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10412,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠笔工李子昭","author":"魏初","text":"广寒秋颖雪离披，汤沐中书旧有期。\n千古管城今乐地，未应人笑是书痴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10413,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"云中郡赋云中一首","author":"魏初","text":"云中近代称名郡，楼阁风烟亦可观。\n一上官庭传德语，文书如涌事如攒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10414,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"献龟","author":"魏初","text":"自叹元非搏击才，海南归棹趁风回。\n一杯汤饼逢今日，独有河神献寿来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10415,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"放龟","author":"魏初","text":"绕足青毛背缕金，未应无意出江深。\n从今去去清渊底，珍重千年共此心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10416,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送李两山","author":"魏初","text":"南来喜见两山诗，袖里春风鬓欲丝。\n明日朝京五千里，正如贾谊入关时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10417,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送李鹤田","author":"魏初","text":"乐章十二见才情，挂剑文章老更成。\n吉水一椽茅屋在，不妨高卧看秋耕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10418,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送敬伯仁","author":"魏初","text":"床头白酒屋头山，未老谁能得此閒。\n收拾宁山哭麟解，更休容易向人间。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10419,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送耶律百强","author":"魏初","text":"不是孤高不爱官，过庭长恐负清欢。\n一盂菽水还家日，衰俗中间得此难。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10420,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送杨季海 其一","author":"魏初","text":"交亲零落鬓如丝，两袖秋风一束诗。\n明日还家有人问，青衫不似读书时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10421,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送杨季海 其二","author":"魏初","text":"险阻艰难四十年，西溪诗笔旧情缘。\n珠帘寂寞西山雨，又逐孤灯上客船。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10422,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"丰州","author":"魏初","text":"五更骑马望明星，细草坡陀迤逦行。\n一片长川天不尽，荞花如雪近丰城。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10423,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"溪亭午憩","author":"魏初","text":"傍溪亭子荫龟鱼，花竹迷藏画不如。\n检点江头春事了，不妨高枕卧看书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10424,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三径纳凉","author":"魏初","text":"阑干欹曲护群芳，恐似陶家欲就荒。\n日午坐来松影合，南风吹雨似秋凉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10425,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题阴德记后","author":"魏初","text":"不为良相愿为医，落落胸中亦自奇。\n一片活人心思在，百年名笔有真知。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10426,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"峡山寺别云宪使文宣慰诗人李梅南","author":"魏初","text":"来时船疾不曾登，去日星飞又促行。\n径为诸公暂留别，四更烧烛看题名。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10427,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"代州别刘云溪公","author":"魏初","text":"爱我疏愚独数君，爱君真实更何人。\n相逢不惜相将去，醉倒玉壶别有春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10428,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄远别","author":"魏初","text":"千里长河五年戍，万山风雪断来音。\n屋头昨夜霜如席，愁折金闺一寸心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10429,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"田家谣","author":"魏初","text":"五月军回未有期，不禁烟瘴入枯脾。\n马头一骨还家日，只有弓刀似旧时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10430,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"为戴秀才题张骞乘槎图","author":"魏初","text":"一片枯槎物外仙，浪花如雪水如烟。\n只应直到天开处，冷笑閒横尽日船。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10431,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"新寨二首 其一","author":"魏初","text":"万事乘除不可期，此行休怪到家迟。\n千山万水秋光里，尽是君家得意时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10432,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"新寨二首 其二","author":"魏初","text":"送别交亲有所思，却愁骑马到家时。\n从渠看得青山饱，人事如今不要诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10433,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"弘州","author":"魏初","text":"百年雄杰玉屏老，疑有英灵在此间。\n几日邻乡买田了，闲时骑马看南山。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10434,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"出湓浦寄刘牧之","author":"魏初","text":"九江一月又吴东，千里青山半日风。\n昨晚看潮亭子上，一尊白酒与君同。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10435,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"胡仲滨益坚斋","author":"魏初","text":"不为求名效独醒，不缘蹭蹬便忘形。\n留教吏部文章在，尽是君家座右铭。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10436,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宿神溪","author":"魏初","text":"千丈危巅鸟道斜，万山深处有人家。\n年来常有催租吏，却恨溪流片片花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10437,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"醉吟","author":"魏初","text":"一别醉乡千古梦，无边尘事百年身。\n青山满眼花如锦，莫遣刘伶笑杀人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10438,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杜止轩词翰","author":"魏初","text":"方朔才名语意新，牧之风调笔如神。\n庞眉苦节秋风客，未必如公出处真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10439,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"十月见蟢子戏成","author":"魏初","text":"蛰后垂纤见亦奇，只应佳信示前知。\n床头镜子拈来看，未分清霜入鬓丝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10440,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"松涧张君","author":"魏初","text":"老涧阴深百丈崖，崖巅松影矗云开。\n几时得向松间醉，细听秋声带雨来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10441,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅坡张君","author":"魏初","text":"曲水亭边酒一卮，风流文雅记当时。\n而今西去船头月，除有梅坡五字诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10442,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹山张君","author":"魏初","text":"山上亭亭竹万竿，山前花木曲阑干。\n高情谁似山人好，教子读书不觅官。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10443,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹","author":"魏初","text":"冷拂苔痕绿影香，细抽空碧出邻墙。\n风来瑟瑟惊秋寂，雨过梢梢弄晚凉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10444,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送僧游蜀","author":"魏初","text":"峨眉山色锦江春，剑壁空岚玉垒尘。\n别后登临有佳句，不妨忙却坐禅身。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10445,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"港口舟行","author":"魏初","text":"鸡犬山田计未成，白头又有海南行。\n只应汤饼逢今日，儿女相看话此情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10446,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送周集贤正平致仕东归","author":"魏初","text":"江山如画四时春，独有?陵气象真。\n馆阁风流有今日，鹿庵之后更何人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10447,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄耿伯玉台掾","author":"魏初","text":"爱君情味唱君词，一别秦亭有所思。\n碧玉骰盘荔枝酒，夹城花暗独来时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10448,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"嘉庆图","author":"魏初","text":"小小瑶华楚楚兰，茶芽瓶子荔枝盘。\n太平三百年前事，犹及江南画里看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10449,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"刘汉卿莲社图","author":"魏初","text":"不为庐山面目真，不因诗酒自由身。\n高情未落龙眠笔，元是羲皇向上人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10450,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"毕舜举兰亭图","author":"魏初","text":"历井扪参蜀道难，扁舟江海又狂澜。\n昔贤觞咏今无复，画里风流亦好看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10451,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"伏生授书图","author":"魏初","text":"心传心学见都俞，秦火烧来一字无。\n若道汉儒无补益，如何留在授书图。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10452,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"韩君美所藏支遁观马图","author":"魏初","text":"千金奇骨岂易得，方外若人犹尔怜。\n自是龙眠有深意，不应参作画中禅。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10453,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"王武子看马图","author":"魏初","text":"深院移床簇侍儿，高盘云髻绿丝丝。\n情知枥下驽骀骨，不到渠家入看时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10454,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题杨国宝藏画马图","author":"魏初","text":"黄马昂头似喙乌，墨云满身千里驹。\n而今沙苑春风里，落日晴芜澹碧铺。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10455,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雁鹭图","author":"魏初","text":"晴溪沙暖鸳鸯睡，小坞花浓蛱蝶飞。\n谁画宾鸿与饥鹭，澹香疏荻雨霏霏。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10456,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题杨国宝鹊华风雨图","author":"魏初","text":"簿书堆山日停午，坐久髭须满尘土。\n争如六月济南间，鹊华峰头看风雨。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10457,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宋上皇诗意图","author":"魏初","text":"月落风烟变古今，画图今见入清吟。\n可怜意象经营日，不到苍生未了心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10458,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"马嵬 其一","author":"魏初","text":"九龄既罢事已矣，偃月堂深祸更深。\n纵把霓裳都拂去，未应边马不骎骎。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10459,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"马嵬 其二","author":"魏初","text":"春草坡前万马尘，麝香犹带荔枝新。\n思量前日盘中舞，含笑君王是路人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10460,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"卜彦才所藏赤壁图","author":"魏初","text":"江山人物记当时，再得坡仙境益奇。\n今日披图见高兴，簿书惭愧鬓如丝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10461,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"出西乡","author":"魏初","text":"人歌人笑上茶园，花淡花浓隔稻田。\n十日按行秋色里，画图才出武陵川。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10462,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"越王台","author":"魏初","text":"春风青草越王台，脚底连云海舶回。\n万国升平有今日，笑人陆贾奉书来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f