857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅岭前人有诗上得梅山不见梅又云着俸买栽三十本清香留与雪中开因次其韵","author":"魏初","text":"南海城边奉使回，庾关曾记岭头梅。\n自怜心似千山雪，不见清香次第开。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10470,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题牧牛图","author":"魏初","text":"流水苍烟绿树坡，青山牛背饱经过。\n生平尽有安排处，辛苦齐人扣角歌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10471,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"凌德荣竹石图","author":"魏初","text":"翠影抽空弄晚凉，雨苔含碧渍秋光。\n漫山桃李春风底，不似幽人意味长。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10472,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄答雷按察 其一","author":"魏初","text":"中州元气文章伯，四海今知有使君。\n一片济时心未了，风棱亦足张吾军。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10473,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄答雷按察 其二","author":"魏初","text":"行役匆匆力未任，欲因衰懒事幽寻。\n诗来重谢多提奖，跛鳖何堪有此心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10474,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题盛教谕家藏山水图","author":"魏初","text":"剪破湘云一片春，澹横浓远总宜人。\n几时跳出黄尘去，此画中间着此身。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10475,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"瞿塘图","author":"魏初","text":"瞿塘事去已千古，芦荻花飞两岸秋。\n四海升平有今日，卧吹箫管到杭州。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10476,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"油井","author":"魏初","text":"细溜津津涌石尖，云腴隐隐复暹暹。\n银釭满贮燃灯坐，似向东川看井盐。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10477,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百井","author":"魏初","text":"才出并州第一程，凭高百井见孤城。\n潇潇风色今如此，却忆梅花雪里行。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10478,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怀古","author":"魏初","text":"人道梁山是帝墟，石楼苔雨上金铺。\n千年留得降王在，辛苦昭陵六马图。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10479,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题李吉甫所藏寥休诗轴","author":"魏初","text":"谁道寥休与世疏，青天推上六龙车。\n看来诗笔今如此，着白山人恐未如。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10480,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"徽州学正胡泳子游自京都来过予于维扬以士常中郎长诗见示又省掾王约彦博谓子游文笔有中州气象用是不敢以常书生遇之十月复会于杭且以乐府辱贶将拿舟归江东因作二十八字以赠","author":"魏初","text":"冠无獬豸带无鱼，鹤步芹宫足自如。\n一片青山满船月，不妨读尽晦翁书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10481,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽宋海印居士二首 其一","author":"魏初","text":"诗酒交亲半老臣，田园成趣自由身。\n回头行路风波里，得似先生有几人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10482,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽宋海印居士二首 其二","author":"魏初","text":"杨柳阴阴拂绿苔，杏花寂寂向谁开。\n黄梁梦觉知何处，白玉楼成不更来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10483,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日对菊忆姜霍二使君 其一","author":"魏初","text":"秋意生香簇绿云，土膏栽满石头盆。\n谁怜白发人千里，独对青山酒一尊。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10484,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日对菊忆姜霍二使君 其二","author":"魏初","text":"高树围前射箭时，小书楼上共题诗。\n扬州灯火京城夜，独立秋风有所思。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10485,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"浑源","author":"魏初","text":"曾从仙子看南山，玉井波深雪色寒。\n今日重来三十载，儿郎骑马是清官。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10486,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]